{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415699","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415699","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041569901:1":{"text":"これはこれは、陛下にお会いできて至極光栄にございます。","source_cn":"向您致敬，尊敬的陛下，能见到您真是我的无上荣幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02240900A729F5E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041569902:1":{"text":"ふん、胡散臭い笑いを浮かべおって。王太子の肩書きに似つかわしくないと思わんのか？","source_cn":"你这让人恶心的笑脸也真是辜负你自己的头衔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD602228F322CB54C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041569903:1":{"text":"まあまあ、その肩書きも、もう過去のことですから――母上の王権もろともね。","source_cn":"毕竟那玩意已经不复存在了——跟我母亲的王权一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB9FC34DDAFDC13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041569904:1":{"text":"なので、王様を見かけると、ついつい挨拶したくなるのですよ。もちろん、あなたが初めてですけどね。","source_cn":"所以每当看到一位国王陛下，我就会忍不住过来打个招呼——...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8588859EBB8CBD1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041569905:1":{"text":"ふふ、「初めて」……なんて美しくも遠い響きでしょう。あなたもそう思うでしょう？この「初めて」に乾杯といきませんか？","source_cn":"哎呀呀，第一次，多么美妙又遥远的词，您想必也有同感吧？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x201848311AFAD430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041569906:1":{"text":"……王太子よりも、道化の方がお似合いだな。お前の母君に同情するよ。","source_cn":"我同情你母亲，比起王储，你更适合当个小丑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37154A530D05F052","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041569907:1":{"text":"まったくもって同感です。けど、偉大な母上はボクのユーモアよりも、能力の方を評価してくれたんですよ。","source_cn":"我也这么觉得，可惜我那伟大的母亲比起我的幽默感，显然更...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x486D646A7D818C1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041569908:1":{"text":"能力？その派手な格好と軽薄な言動のことかね？","source_cn":"能力？你这花里胡哨的模样和轻浮的举止吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79793427C43B5FB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041569909:1":{"text":"見た目なんて些末なものでしょう、陛下。それに、老けて見えるからといって長生きしているとは限らな――","source_cn":"别那么在意外表，陛下，我必须得说，长得老并不代表活得久——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x843B15BF9CE80E29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041569910:1":{"text":"ああ、もちろん、これは一般人に対してのことですよ。なにせ、あなたは二回も「生きて」おられるのですから……","source_cn":"啊，当然了，这话是针对那些凡夫俗子，可不适用于您，毕竟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC07DD93623050BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041569911:1":{"text":"はて、グレイヴボーンとして生まれ変わるのは、「生きている」と言えるのでしょうか？","source_cn":"对了，话说以亡灵之身重返世间，这能叫“活”吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4402158F22F069CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041569912:1":{"text":"……\n何が言いたい？","source_cn":"……\\n你到底想说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C0E1BA504C7EE3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041569913:1":{"text":"いえ、ボクはただ、母上もあなたのようになったらどうしようかと思っただけです。考えただけで恐ろしい……","source_cn":"别在意，只是我有点害怕我母亲像您一样，那可真是世界上最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9859647C5F1E129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041569914:1":{"text":"それに、ボクの年齢はこの美しい見た目よりもずっと上ですからねえ。年数だけで言えば、陛下の兄弟分と大して変わらないかもしれませんよ？","source_cn":"更何况，我的年龄可比我这美丽的外表看起来大不少，按年份...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7763D03D59BA6D1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041569915:1":{"text":"余の兄弟だと？貴様、よほど命が惜しくないようだな。","source_cn":"哈，想当我的兄弟？看起来你是真活够了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BD0D93461FF5479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl